<mxCell id="n27" value="Judges also label preference pairs for reward-model and DPO training and pick winners among samples — both inherit the judge&#x27;s systematic errors. None of these figures is a result on your Zendesk rubric until you measure it there." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=11;align=center;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="396" width="820" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
