<mxCell id="q16" value="keep a win only if it wins both orders; a flip is a tie. GPT-4 few-shot: 65.0% → 77.5% at ~4× prompt cost. Renaming assistants moved Claude off slot one." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#999999;fontSize=10;align=center;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="660" y="120" width="200" height="112" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
